/65 COMMUNICATIONS HANDLER FOR RSX-11M    PAL8-V12B 19-APR-82 PAGE 5

             /THIS PAGE HAS THE INPUT ROUTINE WHICH HAS TO RECOGNIZE
             /WHEN RSX-11M HAS FINISHED SENDING DATA SO IT CAN PUT A
             /CTRL/Z IN THE BUFFER, FILL IT OUT WITH NULLS, AND TAKE
             /THE ERROR RETURN WITHOUT SENDING 'XOFF'.  THIS ROUTINE
             /ALSO TURNS MULTIPLE LF'S INTO MULTIPLE CRLF'S AND BUF-
             /FERS ANY EXTRA CHARACTERS WHICH ARE RECEIVED AFTER THE
             /VAX HAS BEEN SENT AN 'XOFF'.

00400  0577  GETC,   (177            /GETS US V377
00401  7510          SPA
00402  5215          JMP NO1         /FIRST CALL
00403  7640          SZA CLA
00404  5242          JMP EOB         /END OF BUFFER
00405  1301  TADC,   TAD CHAR
00406  7710          SPA CLA         /READ FROM SILO?
00407  2210          ISZ .+1
00410  7402  HOLD,   HLT             /'TAD SILO'
00411  7450          SNA
00412  4313  BOB,    JMS FETCH
00413  0232  C232,   AND C377        /ONLY KEEP 8 BITS
00414  5600          JMP I GETC      /RETURN CHARACTER

00415  3301  NO1,    DCA CHAR        /4000
00416  1205          TAD TADC
00417  3210          DCA HOLD        /INITIALIZE SILO
00420  1267          TAD FLAG        /FIRST CALL AFTER EOF?
             /       SZA CLA
00421  5302  ONCE,   JMP SILO        /ONCE-ONLY CODE
00422  5207          JMP HOLD-1      /RETURN SAVED CHARACTERS
00423  0003  C3,     15-12
00424  3210          DCA HOLD
00425  1251          TAD C1215       /START THINGS WITH A 'CR'
00426  6416          TTLS

00427  4271  GET2,   JMS CCHK        /SKIP THE COMMAND LINE
00430  5227          JMP .-1
00431  6406          KKRB
00432  0377  C377,   AND (177        /FOUND THE LF YET?
00433  1376          TAD (-12
00434  7640          SZA CLA
00435  5227          JMP GET2
00436  4271          JMS CCHK        /WAIT FOR FIRST CHAR
00437  5236          JMP .-1         /WITHOUT TIMING OUT!
00440  7000  IFNDEF  VT278 <NOP>
             IFDEF   VT278 <KKFL>    /KLUDGE TO ZAP EXTRA CR
